<title>USA: First Chicago NBD Corp Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>First Chicago NBD Corp Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary		$1.18		    $1.04</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$1.17		    $1.03</p>
